  "grammar_observation": {
    "target_language": "Bob bore mae Nia'n agor. Bob prynhawn mae Sam yn dod. Bob nos mae Dafi'n darllen. Heddiw mae'r bachgen yn edrych.",
    "bridge_language": "Use bob + a time expression for what happens habitually: bob bore, bob prynhawn, bob nos. Heddiw marks what happens today, including a break in that routine."
  },
